{# Rendered by irrigation_manager/dashboard.py into the storage dashboard. #}

type: grid
cards:
  - type: heading
    heading: "Stato Irrigazione"
    heading_style: title
  - type: custom:button-card
    entity: binary_sensor.irrigation_unlimited_c{{ ctrl.iu_index + 1 }}_m
    template: iu_controller_status
    variables:
      name: "{{ ctrl.name }}"
      availability_entity: "{{ ctrl.availability_entity }}"
      suspend_reason_entity: "sensor.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_suspend_reason"
    grid_options:
      columns: 12
  - type: custom:auto-entities
    card:
      type: entities
      title: "Zona Attiva"
    show_empty: false
    filter:
      include:
        - entity_id: binary_sensor.irrigation_unlimited_c{{ ctrl.iu_index + 1 }}_z*
          state: "on"
          options:
            type: custom:button-card
            entity: this.entity_id
            layout: name_state
            show_name: true
            show_state: false
            show_icon: true
            show_label: true
            label: |
              [[[
                const rem = entity.attributes.time_remaining;
                if (rem) return '⏱ ' + rem + ' rimanenti';
                return '';
              ]]]
            styles:
              card:
                - padding: 8px
              label:
                - color: var(--primary-color)
                - font-size: 12px
                - justify-self: center
              name:
                - justify-self: center
              grid:
                - grid-template-areas: '"i n" "i l"'
                - grid-template-rows: auto
                - grid-template-columns: 20% 80%
              icon:
                - height: 40px
                - width: 40px
                - justify-self: start
    grid_options:
      columns: 12

  - type: horizontal-stack
    cards:
      - type: custom:button-card
        template: iu_tab_button
        entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        variables:
          label: "Prossima"
          icon: mdi:calendar-clock
          option: "Prossima"
      - type: custom:button-card
        template: iu_tab_button
        entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        variables:
          label: "Storico"
          icon: mdi:history
          option: "Storico"
      - type: custom:button-card
        template: iu_tab_button
        entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        variables:
          label: "Smart"
          icon: mdi:sprinkler
          option: "Smart"
      - type: custom:button-card
        template: iu_tab_button
        entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        variables:
          label: "Timeline"
          icon: mdi:chart-timeline
          option: "Timeline"
    grid_options:
      columns: 12

  - type: conditional
    conditions:
      - entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        state: "Prossima"
    card:
      type: markdown
      title: "Prossima Irrigazione"
      content: |
{%- set cm = 'binary_sensor.irrigation_unlimited_c' ~ (ctrl.iu_index + 1) ~ '_m' %}
        {{ '{%' }} set seq = state_attr('{{ cm }}', 'sequence_status') {{ '%}' }}
        {{ '{%' }} set s = seq[0] if seq and seq | length > 0 else none {{ '%}' }}
        {{ '{%' }} if s and s.start {{ '%}' }}
        **Avvio:** {{ '{{' }} s.start | as_datetime | as_local | string | truncate(16, true, '') {{ '}}' }}
        {{ '{%' }} else {{ '%}' }}
        **Nessuna irrigazione programmata**
        {{ '{%' }} endif {{ '%}' }}

        | Zona | Quando | Base | SI stima | IU ora |
        |------|--------|------|----------|--------|
        {%- for z in ctrl.zones %}
        {%- set prog_sensor = 'sensor.' ~ ('IU ' ~ ctrl.name ~ ' Z' ~ z.id ~ ' ' ~ z.name ~ ' Programmato') | slugify %}
        | {{ z.name }} | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'next_prog') | upper {{ '}}' }}{{ '{%' }} if state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'next_cicli') | int(1) > 1 {{ '%}' }} ×{{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'next_cicli') {{ '}}' }}{{ '{%' }} endif {{ '%}' }} | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'base_minutes') | float(0) | round(1) {{ '}}' }} min | {% if z.smart_irrigation %}{{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'si_next_hms') | default('-') {{ '}}' }}{% else %}-{% endif %} | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'next_duration') | default('-', true) {{ '}}' }} |
        {%- endfor %}

        **Base** = durata helper del programma in partenza.
        **SI stima** = quanto scriverà l'adjust (SI ÷ cicli), aggiornato live.
        **IU ora** = quanto IU ha in programma adesso: coincide con SI stima
        solo dopo che l'adjust è girato (5 min prima dell'avvio).
    grid_options:
      columns: 12

  - type: conditional
    conditions:
      - entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        state: "Storico"
    card:
      type: markdown
      title: "Storico Irrigazione"
      content: |
        | Zona | Oggi | Ieri | 2gg fa |
        |------|------|------|--------|
        {%- for z in ctrl.zones %}
        {%- set base = 'sensor.' ~ ('IU ' ~ ctrl.name ~ ' Z' ~ z.id ~ ' ' ~ z.name) | slugify %}
        | {{ z.name }} | {{ '{{' }} (states('{{ base }}_oggi') | float(0) * 60) | round(0) | int {{ '}}' }} min | {{ '{{' }} (states('{{ base }}_ieri') | float(0) * 60) | round(0) | int {{ '}}' }} min | {{ '{{' }} (states('{{ base }}_2gg_fa') | float(0) * 60) | round(0) | int {{ '}}' }} min |
        {%- endfor %}
    grid_options:
      columns: 12

  - type: conditional
    conditions:
      - entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        state: "Smart"
    card:
      type: markdown
      title: "Smart Irrigation"
      content: |
        Deficit idrico corrente e volume che SI erogherebbe **col bucket
        di adesso**, senza aspettare l'adjust.

        | Zona | Bucket | Durata | Litri | mm |
        |------|--------|--------|-------|----|
        {%- for z in ctrl.zones if z.smart_irrigation %}
        {%- set prog_sensor = 'sensor.' ~ ('IU ' ~ ctrl.name ~ ' Z' ~ z.id ~ ' ' ~ z.name ~ ' Programmato') | slugify %}
        {%- set si_sensor = z.si_sensor %}
        | {{ z.name }} | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'bucket_mm') {{ '}}' }} mm | {{ '{{' }} states('{{ si_sensor }}') | int(0) {{ '}}' }}s | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'litri') {{ '}}' }} | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'mm_erogati') {{ '}}' }} |
        {%- endfor %}

        **Calibrazione zona** — `s/mm = multiplier × size / portata × 60`

        | Zona | Size | Portata | s/mm | a 2mm |
        |------|------|---------|------|-------|
        {%- for z in ctrl.zones if z.smart_irrigation %}
        {%- set prog_sensor = 'sensor.' ~ ('IU ' ~ ctrl.name ~ ' Z' ~ z.id ~ ' ' ~ z.name ~ ' Programmato') | slugify %}
        | {{ z.name }} | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'size_m2') {{ '}}' }} m² | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 'throughput_l_min') {{ '}}' }} l/min | {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 's_per_mm') {{ '}}' }} | {{ '{{' }} (state_attr('{{ prog_sensor }}', 's_per_mm') | float(0) * 2) | round(0) | int {{ '}}' }}s |
        {%- endfor %}

        _s/mm e "a 2mm" valgono 0 subito dopo un reset bucket: servono
        dati ET accumulati per calcolarli._

        {%- set si_list = ctrl.zones | selectattr('smart_irrigation') | list %}
        {%- if si_list %}
        {%- set first_si = si_list[0] %}
        {%- set fs = 'sensor.' ~ ('IU ' ~ ctrl.name ~ ' Z' ~ first_si.id ~ ' ' ~ first_si.name ~ ' Programmato') | slugify %}

        _Ultimo calcolo SI: {{ '{{' }} state_attr('{{ fs }}', 'si_calcolato_alle') {{ '}}' }} — ricalcolo automatico ogni ora al minuto 10._
        {%- endif %}
    grid_options:
      columns: 12

  - type: conditional
    conditions:
      - entity: select.iu_{{ ctrl.id }}_status_tab
        state: "Timeline"
    card:
      type: custom:apexcharts-card
      header:
        show: true
        title: Watering timeline
        show_states: false
      graph_span: 10d
      span:
        start: day
        offset: '-7day'
      all_series_config:
        type: column
        group_by:
          duration: 1d
          func: sum
          fill: 'null'
        show:
          as_duration: minute
      now:
        show: true
        label: Today
      series:
{%- for z in ctrl.zones %}
        - entity: binary_sensor.irrigation_unlimited_c{{ ctrl.iu_index + 1 }}_z{{ z.id }}
          name: "{{ z.name }}"
          data_generator: |
            return entity.attributes.timeline.map((item) => {
              const sd = new Date(item.start);
              const ed = new Date(item.end);
              return [sd, (ed - sd) / 60000];
            });
{%- endfor %}
      yaxis:
        - decimals: 0
          apex_config:
            title:
              text: minutes
      apex_config:
        tooltip:
          enabled: true
          x:
            format: dd MMM
    grid_options:
      columns: 12
